# Cid's Secret (bastok 26): Cid in the Metalworks, Hilda in Port Bastok. The guard (Bastok fame level 4), the offer 507,
# Cid's 502 (Prog 0) and 508 (Prog 1, both importantEvent), Hilda's 132 (Prog 0 -> 1), the Rolanberry (874 C.E.) trade
# for the Unfinished Letter (133), then Cid's 509 and the reward; Hilda's 49 (replaceDefault) once completed. Cid's
# default is 500, Hilda's 48; Hilda walks a path (her script). The Bastok and CoP missions and the other quests that
# name Cid (Chips, Dark Puppet, Shoot First, Ask Questions Later) need a mission or a job this char lacks; The Usual
# needs fame level 5, and LB04 and mission 7-2 need what this char lacks.
lists Metalworks/Cid/onTrigger PortBastok/Hilda/onTrigger PortBastok/Hilda/onTrade Metalworks/onEventFinish/507 Metalworks/onEventFinish/509 PortBastok/onEventFinish/132 PortBastok/onEventFinish/133
char zone=Metalworks pos=-14,-11,0
fame Bastok 224
item Rolanberry874Ce
item BoneChip
login
trigger Cid                    # fame 224 (level 3): his default 500
finish
fame Bastok 225
warp -155.4,-11.38,18.66 PortBastok
trigger Hilda                  # available: no handler, her default 48
finish
trade Hilda Rolanberry874Ce x1 # available: no trade handler, nothing
warp -14,-11,0 Metalworks
trigger Cid                    # fame level 4: the offer, 507
finish                         # accepted
trigger Cid                    # Prog 0, no letter: 502
finish
warp -155.4,-11.38,18.66 PortBastok
trigger Hilda                  # accepted: 132
finish                         # Prog 0: Prog 1
trigger Hilda                  # 132 again
finish                         # Prog already 1: nothing
trade Hilda BoneChip x1        # the wrong item: nil, nothing
warp -14,-11,0 Metalworks
trigger Cid                    # Prog 1, no letter: 508
finish
warp -155.4,-11.38,18.66 PortBastok
trigger Hilda                  # 132
finish                         # Prog stays 1
trade Hilda Rolanberry874Ce x1 # Prog 1 and the Rolanberry: 133
finish                         # the Rolanberry taken, the Unfinished Letter
trigger Hilda                  # the letter held: 132 still
finish
warp -14,-11,0 Metalworks
trigger Cid                    # the letter: 509
finish                         # completed: Ram Mantle, fame +40, the letter deleted
trigger Cid                    # completed: 500
finish
warp -155.4,-11.38,18.66 PortBastok
trigger Hilda                  # completed (fame 265, level 4: no The Usual): 49
finish
trade Hilda BoneChip x1        # completed: no trade handler, nothing
